Note on third-party material
============================

The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository — the HTML, CSS,
JavaScript and Python that make the site work.

It does not, and cannot, cover material in this repository that belongs to
someone else. That includes at least:

  - img/brain.glb — the 3-D brain mesh, by dgallichan via Sketchfab,
    licensed CC-BY-4.0. Attribution is required if you reuse it.
  - img/magritte_falsemirror.jpg, research/img/era-*.jpg and
    research/img/art_*.jpg — reproductions of artworks and historical
    photographs, included here as illustration.
  - research/img/train_ciotat_*.webp / .jpg — frames of the Lumière
    brothers' L'Arrivée d'un train en gare de La Ciotat (1896).
  - publications/*/*.pdf and publications/*/featured.* — papers and figures
    whose rights sit with their publishers and co-authors.
  - information/img/logo_sussex.svg and the photographs of the University of
    Sussex — University of Sussex marks and imagery.
  - research/img/logo-*.png — the marks of the software projects they name.
  - Photographs of lab members and lab events.

If you want to reuse any of that, the licence you need is theirs, not this one.
